          <h2 class="section-title">What Is Shaolin Kung Fu</h2>
          <p>
            Kung Fu is not a specific style; instead it is a catch all word for chinese martial arts. 
			In Kali Kempo Self Defense, we teach portions from various chinese martial arts, in the same way that the Shaolin Kung Fu absorbed, developed and taught martial arts.
          </p>
		  <p>
			We teach breathing techniques from Qigong, QinNa (also known as grappling), from Tai Chi, hand strikes, power generation and forms from Shaolin Kung Fu, 
			and a variation of footwork developed in part by bagua.
		  </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

