      <div class="container grid grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="section-title">How Shaolin Kempo Karate Into Kali Kempo Self Defense</h2>
		  <p>
			We teach breathing techniques from Qigong, QinNa (also known as grappling), from Tai Chi, hand strikes, power generation and forms from Shaolin Kung Fu, 
			and a variation of footwork developed in part by bagua. These are seen as an enhancement and supplement to the weapon arts of Pekiti Tirsia Kali, and the unarmed style of Shaolin Kempo Karate.
		  </p>
